          <div class="ct-top"><h3 class="ct-name">tool-smith</h3><span class="ct-link"><span aria-hidden="true">GitHub ↗</span></span></div>
          <div class="ct-desc">Fine-tuned Qwen2.5-0.5B into a tool-calling router (PEFT + TRL, LoRA/SFT) — <b>fully-correct tool calls 4.1% → 74.2%, hard cases 0 → 76.7%</b> on a self-built base-vs-tuned eval. Wrapped in an engineered agent loop: validate → auto-repair retry → frontier fallback → full JSONL logging.
            </div>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">PEFT/TRL</span><span class="tag">LoRA</span><span class="tag">FastMCP</span><span class="tag">agent loop</span></div>
        </a>

