          <div class="ct-top"><h3 class="ct-name">AIGC content pipeline &amp; the 70+ skill matrix</h3><span class="ct-link"><span aria-hidden="true">GitHub ↗</span></span></div>
          <div class="ct-desc">An end-to-end production line — script → visuals → cloned-voice TTS (MiniMax / ElevenLabs / F5-TTS) → ffmpeg mux → subtitle QA — driving bilingual dev content across TikTok / X / IG and Xiaohongshu / Douyin / Bilibili — <b>1000+ targeted developer followers</b> across platforms. Built on a self-made matrix of 70+ Claude Code Skills &amp; 20+ MCP Servers, including <b>paper-search-server</b> (Scopus search over Flask).
            </div>
