        <div class="cap reveal d2"><div class="ci" aria-hidden="true">A3</div><h3 class="ch">Model Fine-tuning</h3><div class="cl"><b>PEFT + TRL · LoRA / SFT</b> on Apple Silicon / MPS — Qwen2.5-0.5B tool router (rank 16). Applied engineering, not algorithm research.</div></div>
